      value: 2.76
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8342701953548561964, guid: e7845076b07350f4a874cfee3336f381, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '<i>Title</i>

        <size=0.6em> Iris Acro is known for her use of
        vivid colors and the portrayal of childlike wonder in her paintings. She
        was born in a city on the west side of Portugal named Peniche. Here she uncovered
        her desire to create, and shared those creations with her community. After
        being encouraged by her loving family to pursue her passion, she moved to
        Florence to attend the Classical Arts Academy there. After her studies she
        began to experiment more with her art which led to her unique approach to
        painting.


        In her new exhibition, named ''Eyes'', she strived to
        convey the emotions she felt under the pressure of being an artist. After
        she gained succes she felt there was no more room left to make mistakes.
        With this exhibition she wants to share those feelings of constantly being
        watched. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8342701953548561964, guid: e7845076b07350f4a874cfee3336f381, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontSize
      value: 9.2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8342701953548561964, guid: e7845076b07350f4a874cfee3336f381, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontSizeBase
      value: 9.2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8342701953548561964, guid: e7845076b07350f4a874cfee3336f381, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_enableAutoSizing
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8643596295579920061, guid: e7845076b07350f4a874cfee3336f381, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalPosition.y
      value: 0.0033
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
