    - target: {fileID: 8342701953548561964, guid: e7845076b07350f4a874cfee3336f381, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '<i></i>

        <size=0.6em> Made by the same Nameless Painter, these
        seemed to be made later in life and developed a more surrealist style, in
        which he often painted strange figures staring at the viewer.  Are they people,
        or figments of imagination? The truth remains unknown.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
