      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '<i>Time</i>

        <size=0.6em>This exposition by Anna Perenna shows
        the feeling of time passing by. Peope often have fears of growing old, but
        there is also a sense of beauty in age. For some however, this is a prelude
        for the inevitable end'
