      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '<u><b>Spiralling</u></b>

        This room holds a variety of art
        pieces that depict a similar theme. A sculpture made of concrete, but organic
        spirals emit from inside. Paintings depicting figures twisting and turning.
        Is it the body, or the mind that spirals down?'
